entries[364916] = { ["name"] = "Pallid Command", ["text"] = "Shadow\nCasting Unholy Nova summons a Rattling Mage that gains 2% additional damage and healing each time an enemy affected by Unholy Transfusion is damaged by an ally, up to 100%.\n\nThe Rattling Mage serves you for 20 sec, blasting your target for (25.1% of Spell Power) Shadow damage.\n\nHoly\nCasting Unholy Nova summons a Brooding Cleric that gains 2% additional damage and healing each time an enemy affected by Unholy Transfusion is damaged by an ally, up to 100%.\n\nThe Brooding Cleric serves you for 20 sec, healing an ally for (40% of Spell Power).\n\nDiscipline\nCasting Unholy Nova summons a Brooding Cleric that gains 2% additional damage and healing each time an enemy affected by Unholy Transfusion is damaged by an ally, up to 100%.\n\nThe Brooding Cleric serves you for 20 sec, healing an ally for (40% of Spell Power)." }
